id: hide
name: Hide
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
special: true
usageLimit: 1/round
source: Core Rule
description: >
  A Clash of your Stealth against the Perception of every Opponent whose Melee Range you are not in: win, and you are
  Hidden from them.
text: >
  Hide Maneuver [1/Round]: Get out of sight to get the drop on your opponents.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: Free
  –KP Cost: N/A
  –Exploitable: N/A
  –Effect: Make a Skill Clash (Stealth vs Perception) against all of your Opponents (except those you are in the Melee
  Range of). If you win against an Opponent, you become Hidden from that Opponent.

---

# Opened by 2+ Ranks in Stealth (the user's ruling). Who the Opponents are is asked when it is used - everyone in the
# Combat Encounter, ticked but for those whose Melee Range you stand in (measured on the tokens) - and each gets a
# Clash of their own (use-maneuver.mjs askHide). Won, Hidden from them (module/hidden.mjs).
